                                                "sense_id": "50860b0e-d3c2-3450-be90-90525a94b908",
                                                "text": "We shall see in sec. 6.2 that our result for S#95;3(a) can be expressed in terms of special functions, whose asymptotics are well-known. There we show also that the asymptotic form forS#95;3(a) obtained from the asymptotics of the special functions is identical to the asymptotic form obtained via Eq. (3.1)."
